# Blasmusiker: brass-band tuba player in Tracht - green G/g/j jacket, white
# collar, Kniebundhose l/O, white socks, dark hat d/m with a white feather,
# brown hair and a big moustache O/l. Prop: the tuba Y/o/O with a w glint,
# bell facing front (his facing side; mirror = auto), dark l/O bell throat.
# inhale (telegraph) = cheeks puffed E, tuba bell raised high and tilted up.
# blow = eyes squeezed, cheeks half puffed, bell level (notes come out at
# about 10 px above the feet, in front of the bell).
sprite = blasmusiker
size   = 24x24
origin = 12,24
hitbox = 6,2,12,22
mirror = auto
anim   = idle     frames=2 ticks=30 loop
anim   = inhale   frames=1
anim   = blow     frames=1
anim   = squished frames=1
